ename":"IssueComment","databaseId":714789594,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"deanoemcke","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTE3NjM="},"id":"MDU6SXNzdWU2NDIyNDMzNjI=","number":1175,"locked":false,"databaseId":642243362},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"lucasdf","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7062224?u=f77405ada2584df8b58dcac11560c36e63b079db\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/lucasdf","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjIyMjQ=","name":"Lucas Ferreira"},"id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNDc4OTU5NA==","url":"https://github.com/greatsuspender/thegreatsuspender/issues/1175#issuecomment-714789594","createdAt":"2020-10-22T22:08:42Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Would be great to hear more about this. Unfortunately, there has been cases of \"mysterious buyers\" taking over projects and injecting malware on them (see https://github.com/NanoAdblocker/NanoCore/issues/362). I don't have any reason to believe that the deal here might be in any way problematic like this, but the lack of information is worrisome. For now I am using a local version instead of the one provided by Google store.\r\n\r\nps: thank you for all your work in this project!","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWould be great to hear more about this. Unfortunately, there has been cases of \"mysterious buyers\" taking over projects and injecting malware on them (see \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"714154200\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NanoAdblocker/NanoCore/issues/362\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NanoAdblocker/NanoCore/issues/362/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NanoAdblocker/NanoCore/issues/362\"\u003eNanoAdblocker/NanoCore#362\u003c/a\u003e). I don't have any reason to believe that the deal here might be in any way problematic like this, but the lack of information is worrisome. For now I am using a local version instead of the one provided by Google store.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eps: thank you for all your work in this project!\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"9a23f953f99498cd9c95f8ba1d84560d5c54ba0ee1321cfa007c959e7a00dd8b","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk1NzczMTAw","name":"thegreatsuspender","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjAzODI4","login":"greatsuspender","url":"https://github.com/greatsuspender"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"greatsuspender/thegreatsuspender","databaseId":5773100},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":70,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"AmperAndSand","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1404745?s=64\u0026u=c46a1fa7d191c2c8e88dd73173fea7e13e604f7d\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDQ3NDU="},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"Poopooracoocoo","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51363864?s=64\u0026u=d8fed23682c70fbc6681ccd5d44f7f82c8bbcb90\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzYzODY0"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"hbh7","name":"hbh7","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5050375?s=64\u0026u=e86c69368ac686b077912f286a52eef6764de256\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTAzNzU="},{"__typename":"Us