"profileUrl":"https://github.com/danupo","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjUwMTA2","name":"danupo"},"id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNzY0ODEwNQ==","url":"https://github.com/greatsuspender/thegreatsuspender/issues/1175#issuecomment-717648105","createdAt":"2020-10-28T02:05:27Z","authorAssociation":"NONE","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"![addisional_code](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18250106/97381503-92e95800-190c-11eb-8096-53e9a404a70c.png)\r\nThe code has been added to **gsAnalytics.js** and appears **to be calling javascript from outside.**\r\nThe called code was obfuscated and I couldn't understand it...\r\nI'm not an expert, so I don't know any more than this.\r\n\r\ngsAnalytics.jsにコードが追加され、外部からjavascriptを呼び出しているように見えます。\r\n呼び出されたコードは難読化されていて、私には分かりませんでした・・・\r\n私は専門家ではないので、これ以上のことはわかりません。\r\n\r\n私は英語が分からないので、機械翻訳でごめんなさい。\r\nI don't understand English, so sorry for the machine translation.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18250106/97381503-92e95800-190c-11eb-8096-53e9a404a70c.png\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18250106/97381503-92e95800-190c-11eb-8096-53e9a404a70c.png\" alt=\"addisional_code\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe code has been added to \u003cstrong\u003egsAnalytics.js\u003c/strong\u003e and appears \u003cstrong\u003eto be calling javascript from outside.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe called code was obfuscated and I couldn't understand it...\u003cbr\u003e\nI'm not an expert, so I don't know any more than this.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003egsAnalytics.jsにコードが追加され、外部からjavascriptを呼び出しているように見えます。\u003cbr\u003e\n呼び出されたコードは難読化されていて、私には分かりませんでした・・・\u003cbr\u003e\n私は専門家ではないので、これ以上のことはわかりません。\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e私は英語が分からないので、機械翻訳でごめんなさい。\u003cbr\u003e\nI don't understand English, so sorry for the machine translation.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"a0b14979f6366250ff2b56763fcde9b57a9cf44c0314f8a8701c41f17e1dffd4","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk1NzczMTAw","name":"thegreatsuspender","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjAzODI4","login":"greatsuspender","url":"https://github.com/greatsuspender"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"greatsuspender/thegreatsuspender","databaseId":5773100},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":95,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"oddhack","name":"Jon Leech","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4693344?s=64\u0026u=08e381cd7f73db90c34ec2e7b6d207816ad262d0\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTMzNDQ="},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"joshmanders","name":"Josh Manders","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/352113?s=64\u0026u=6dc1eb9f564bc00b08ebdc0cf447ea45010b65ed\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MjExMw=="},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"Poopooracoocoo","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51363864?s=64\u0026u=d8fed23682c70fbc6681ccd5d44f7f82c8bbcb90\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzYzODY0"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"chanibal","name":"Krzysztof Bociurko","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/697605?s=64\u0026v=4","__isNode":